 * Always Retries: By removing the scheduleFlag check, every failure (even if a user manually clicked "Approve") is forced into the retry queue (BATCH_STATUS = 'Q').
 * Proper Logic: It checks retryCount. If it is less than 5, it tells the user "Please wait". If it reaches 5, it tells the user "unexpected database or server timeout."
 * No "SYSTEM ERROR" Text: The notification messages are cleaned up to use "Execution alert" instead of the scary system error text.
